<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rand Mines pre-exceps H1 shr down sharply.</title>
<headline>Rand Mines pre-exceps H1 shr down sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  (189.7)     vs   (70.0)</p>
<p>- before exceptional</p>
<p>    charge			 4.8	vs    17.1</p>
<p>    Retained surplus	  11.26     vs   122.76</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit/</p>
<p>    (deficit)		 (113.06)    vs   (37.37)</p>
<p>Taxation in</p>
<p>    subsidiary		   0.09     vs     -</p>
<p>    Interest received	  5.03     vs     6.06</p>
<p>    Turnover			-	 vs     -</p>
<p>    Exceptional charge     116.00     vs    51.94</p>
<p>Full name: Rand Mines Limited</p>
<p>NOTE - No dividend was declared during the six months to March 31 1997.</p>
<p>The process of winding up the company would be initiated should the group not manage to acquire viable assets in the near future, Rand Mines said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
